The files Seatworks kept in state format 4, as a machine with one project held them. Never edited:
a new format gets its own folder, and state.test.ts carries every folder up to the current one.
Format 4 takes in upstream's lane and task additions in one step: Lane.onBranch, lanes that wait,
a landed mark, amendment history and tasks that wait. L1 carried on the Human's branch, landed after
one amendment; L1-T2 waited for L1-T1, was held when its Peer could not start, and was cut as L1 closed.
Machine files are format 3's (queued outbox letters, launch-profile visibility).
